      "content": "small steps dont change the fact that i'm stuck. it's not just being tired, it's this heavy feeling that my entire life belongs to everyone but me. like i'm just a machine meant to serve and pay bills until i break. i look at my kids and i love them, but sometimes i just... i just want it all to stop. i want to not feel this pressure anymore. i want peace.",
